  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support measures to enhance EU cooperation and strengthen capacity of Civil Society Organisations in the Kingdom of Eswatini</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To enhance the EU cooperation in Eswatini by providing technical, strategic and logistical support to targeted Civil Society Organisations and supporting EU&#xbf;s programming in the country with CSOs across the thematic areas of human rights, gender, youth and disability.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
